{"chunk_id": "dataset-content", "source_id": "mvtec", "title": "資料集內容", "text": "MVTec AD 工業異常檢測資料集（Dataset）包含超過 5,000 張圖片與 15 種物件及材質類別，提供正常訓練圖片、正常與異常測試圖片，以及像素級異常標註（Pixel-level Annotation）。", "source_url": "https://www.mvtec.com/research-teaching/datasets/mvtec-ad", "source_locator": "官方資料集說明", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "17005ba39fc61ed5d2e32677bc0e073bdbab5b14eb4a942b265ba3e0ca9f01ce"}
{"chunk_id": "dataset-license", "source_id": "mvtec", "title": "資料授權", "text": "MVTec AD 採姓名標示、非商業性、相同方式分享 4.0 授權（CC BY-NC-SA 4.0），使用與分享資料需遵守條款，商業使用需另洽資料提供者。", "source_url": "https://www.mvtec.com/research-teaching/datasets/mvtec-ad", "source_locator": "官方資料集說明", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "53765e5534d11fb1afa1437f552ab35d8c23ccb2e776f8656b7ded0e7f105b57"}
{"chunk_id": "download-folders", "source_id": "downloads", "title": "下載後的資料夾", "text": "瓶子（Bottle）子集的官方下載大小約 148 MB，解壓縮後有 train 正常訓練圖片、test 測試圖片及 ground_truth 異常區域遮罩三個主要資料夾。", "source_url": "https://www.mvtec.com/research-teaching/datasets/mvtec-ad/downloads", "source_locator": "Download the MVTec AD dataset", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "8c370437965dc1565c22870d72b01c77ab285b7bfc131706b148d879aaec397e"}
{"chunk_id": "method-nominal", "source_id": "patchcore", "title": "正常樣本與局部特徵", "text": "PatchCore 使用正常樣本的局部特徵建立具代表性的記憶庫（Memory Bank），利用預訓練影像特徵處理異常檢測與定位，適用於先取得正常外觀樣本的設定。", "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.08265v2", "source_locator": "Abstract", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "e5c34176a1713e6c8e75d6fc55d4eee1c76ce0a5694520f00861a5b1b34e192d"}
{"chunk_id": "method-neighbor", "source_id": "anomalib", "title": "最近鄰與異常分數", "text": "Anomalib 的 PatchCore 擷取預訓練骨幹的中間層特徵，推論時搜尋特徵庫中的最近鄰（Nearest Neighbor），以局部特徵距離產生異常分數與異常分布圖。", "source_url": "https://anomalib.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown/guides/reference/models/image/patchcore.html", "source_locator": "PatchCore / Architecture", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "0800b1492d986e232bd815a71d83ce994acd9054f405486e8c505e576552ac56"}
{"chunk_id": "embedding-e5", "source_id": "e5", "title": "跨語言文字向量", "text": "Multilingual E5 Small 是 384 維的多語言文字向量模型（Embedding Model），檢索時問題加 query: 前綴、段落加 passage: 前綴，向量正規化後可比較相似程度，模型卡標示 MIT 授權。", "source_url": "https://huggingface.co/intfloat/multilingual-e5-small", "source_locator": "Usage / Model card", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "1e7ce969c970d19b35396091a8945864dfdce1b1291e0cd34f5b416871346623"}
{"chunk_id": "index-faiss", "source_id": "faiss", "title": "向量搜尋工具", "text": "FAISS 提供稠密向量（Dense Vector）的相似度搜尋與分群功能，可用來建立圖片或文字的向量索引，段落文字與來源仍需另外保存。", "source_url": "https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss", "source_locator": "README / Introduction", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "5df181d76ee76071e0fdfe37e0a32397bfe43e6346f9997a05f5b2a138dd324f"}
{"chunk_id": "config-backbone", "source_id": "project-config", "title": "目前模型骨幹", "text": "本專題 bottle 第一版採 ResNet18 預訓練骨幹（Backbone），取 layer2 與 layer3 特徵，輸入解析度為 128 × 128，並使用 CPU 與 4 個執行緒，這是本機基準設定。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/evaluation/vision_baseline_v1/config.json", "source_locator": "baseline config", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "57359e0592570b46b75008ddad841c979a236e9556528d17769928b12ea28e36"}
{"chunk_id": "config-coreset", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "特徵抽樣與最近鄰", "text": "本次代表性核心集（Coreset）的抽樣比例為 1%，最近鄰數 num_neighbors 為 1，隨機種子為 42，正常特徵庫保留 458 個 384 維向量。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "717d9c0a419c5c59d61f7f5b4cb608460b9d16fe020a8bbdd22e481c6dd8f087"}
{"chunk_id": "config-threshold", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "影像判斷門檻", "text": "影像門檻（Image Threshold）採 30 張正常校準圖片的最高分數，約為 10.19447，分數大於門檻才判為異常，門檻在讀取測試結果前固定，沒有使用測試標籤調整。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "6b4f6e5eb7ab467005a8e1678c0e9d1912b62ae68fb377c2809ce482d16dc526"}
{"chunk_id": "config-heatmap", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "共用熱圖色階", "text": "熱圖疊圖（Heatmap Overlay）共用正常校準資料決定的色階，正常圖片也可能有非零反應，並排範例的色階上限是校準分數圖最大值的兩倍，顏色只協助觀察局部分數。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "000590d034f938233b31617621f017fa630c5b768b2aa234a2139e69cd6c47ed"}
{"chunk_id": "config-no-probability", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "分數與機率", "text": "異常分數（Anomaly Score）表示目前特徵與正常外觀的偏離程度，數值受模型和設定影響，尚未做機率校準，因此 0.8 或其他分數都不能解讀成瑕疵機率。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "d018540427684ef59f0be39d177fe3d92888f5d721db1768412face7606401ec"}
{"chunk_id": "split-fit", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "正常訓練與校準切分", "text": "原始 209 張正常訓練圖片中，179 張建立特徵庫、30 張作為正常校準集（Calibration Set），依排序與隨機種子 42 固定分組，校準圖片沒有放進特徵庫。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "6bf7e16104c07ae15b9870de2778f9e314bafac2260b51ecebb3fda7ea2868c7"}
{"chunk_id": "split-test", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "保留測試資料", "text": "原始測試集（Test Set）有 83 張圖片，其中 20 張正常、63 張異常，只在模型與校準規則固定後評估，瑕疵遮罩只供評估和圖像對照。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "72a78a187f1426f2fb03f07e2e6855ed7eddfcbc73ba8d0c963c573103ed2ed2"}
{"chunk_id": "metrics-ranking", "source_id": "project-metrics", "title": "整體排序評估", "text": "這次 bottle 基準的影像級排序指標（Image AUROC）為 0.996031746，像素級排序指標（Pixel AUROC）為 0.966502604，兩者衡量排序能力，不能等同分類正確率。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/evaluation/vision_baseline_v1/metrics.json", "source_locator": "aggregate metrics", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "d5ab60b12c96b89393ae8178b07cf1e64a65e3cbf17a978dfc07630d14bb5320"}
{"chunk_id": "metrics-resolution", "source_id": "project-metrics", "title": "像素評估解析度", "text": "像素級評估（Pixel Evaluation）在 128 × 128 進行，原始 900 × 900 遮罩以最近鄰縮放後再比較，熱圖放大顯示不會增加模型解析度，也不能宣稱原尺寸定位表現。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/evaluation/vision_baseline_v1/metrics.json", "source_locator": "aggregate metrics", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "c2c53df22e39088c91b8c46d9a65a70bb5741f40e533ccd97107dca536822529"}
{"chunk_id": "metrics-confusion", "source_id": "project-metrics", "title": "誤報與漏檢數量", "text": "固定門檻下，20 張正常測試圖片沒有誤報，63 張異常測試圖片找出 61 張、漏檢 2 張，異常召回率（Anomaly Recall）為 61 ÷ 63，約 96.83%。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/evaluation/vision_baseline_v1/metrics.json", "source_locator": "aggregate metrics", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "7ea190a369bb54bf90b6999176dc10dd81357e8928dd877cecd84bd2cc4309de"}
{"chunk_id": "metrics-latency", "source_id": "project-metrics", "title": "推論等待時間", "text": "暖機後的 CPU 推論時間，中位數（p50）約 13.3 毫秒、第 95 百分位（p95）約 14.4 毫秒，包含讀圖與前處理，排除模型載入、存圖與報告，並非整個服務等待時間。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/evaluation/vision_baseline_v1/metrics.json", "source_locator": "aggregate metrics", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "986191c939ae3e6ff705c2368ef079bdd30727aac4524bd8379263b733791af5"}
{"chunk_id": "limit-generalization", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "泛化與真實產線限制", "text": "目前只測試 bottle 一個類別與一個隨機種子，尚無信賴區間或真實產線驗證，拍攝環境、產品外觀與資料分布改變時需要重新評估，不能直接套用現有成效。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "f8e675fdbe0882b8ccbdde37ba91a31624f6616a1e80dcb9ef91a505c8d729a3"}
{"chunk_id": "limit-calibration", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "校準門檻的限制", "text": "30 張正常校準樣本的最大值只能提供目前的判斷門檻，無法保證未來資料的假陽性率（False Positive Rate），正常測試資料也只有 20 張，零誤報仍有樣本數限制。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "8aad58ca3fe1db3a40582217d1e6b3f5926fcbee16ac2f00a9f965224b00cc18"}
{"chunk_id": "data-counts", "source_id": "project-data", "title": "已驗證圖片數量", "text": "第一階段驗證了 292 張檢驗圖片與 63 張瑕疵遮罩（Ground-truth Masks），共 355 個 PNG 檔，圖片尺寸皆為 900 × 900，圖片為 RGB、遮罩為單通道。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/data/manifests/bottle_validation.json", "source_locator": "validation summary", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "63f6244d4729e4418820c7849810e3c1a0cb05133c5778dc78c12e94a970de99"}
{"chunk_id": "data-integrity", "source_id": "project-data", "title": "檔案檢查與標註限制", "text": "資料驗證檢查解碼、遮罩二元值、圖片與遮罩的對應及尺寸，未發現訓練與測試之間像素完全相同的圖片，近似重複與標註語意正確性仍需要額外檢查。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/data/manifests/bottle_validation.json", "source_locator": "validation summary", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "5383e45063767bc12fbda8fafee5cb0f71a580dde2bdd3baf43d09cdbc2ec137"}
{"chunk_id": "use-no-root-cause", "source_id": "project-scope", "title": "根因與允收範圍", "text": "專題目前可提供外觀分數、參考圖與方法說明，製程根因（Root Cause）、修復處置與產品允收標準（Acceptance Criteria）缺少專業資料支持，這類問題需要回覆證據不足。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/README.md", "source_locator": "資料切分 / 功能範圍", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "fc2f96589408f5c7f8a268fd0f514d8317941099353c140d06e507703639a72e"}
{"chunk_id": "use-memory", "source_id": "project-scope", "title": "案件記憶規劃", "text": "案件記憶（Agent Memory）規劃保存分析版本、已確認資訊、摘要與證據編號，推論與使用者確認事實分開標記，目前案件資料庫與代理記憶尚未實作。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/README.md", "source_locator": "資料切分 / 功能範圍", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "4d75bae664b6d1c4416fcfbca222ebe86a7784c25aabf4c0cd3b335113dbe029"}
{"chunk_id": "use-local-files", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "模型與分析產物位置", "text": "模型檢查點（Checkpoint）保存在 artifacts/vision_baseline_v1/patchcore_bottle.pt，熱圖與單張推論結果保留本機，原始圖片、權重與執行環境不放進公開 GitHub。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "93353360a5a1e65ed743629e10efde75c941814e914c4697c9f50cf1f931a283"}
{"chunk_id": "use-cli-predict", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "單張推論操作", "text": "在專案根目錄執行 .venv/bin/python scripts/predict_image.py 圖片路徑，會載入已保存的模型並產生分數與熱圖，輸出位置用 --output 指定，既有資料夾不會覆寫。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "4ae2e1aa847f32480be19b415c340e4b6128f54c129cb457c875d19f478b3fcb"}
{"chunk_id": "use-cli-baseline", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "重新執行基準", "text": "執行 scripts/run_vision_baseline.py 可以重建基準，若輸出資料夾已存在會停止，重跑需用 --output 與 --report-dir 指定新位置，保留先前實驗紀錄。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "0d58f3ccf8a0952393937d5fe299c3b86d85eed577a0cae07130c8f6c1fbc017"}
{"chunk_id": "use-locked-env", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "環境與版本", "text": "視覺環境（Vision Environment）使用 Python 3.12，直接套件寫在 requirements-vision.txt，完整 Mac 套件快照在 requirements-vision.lock.txt，跨平台仍需確認相容性。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "5a82420c2c81e9fcd089d7526544601b9f8867d8934f36ddadc71016e3e6125e"}
{"chunk_id": "use-checkpoint", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "重新載入與一致性", "text": "單張推論載入模型檢查點時不需要重建特徵庫，測試已確認正常與異常各一張的重新載入分數，與保存的基準結果一致，模型雜湊用於辨識版本。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "5230a576733bf93a1cafdaf29274ec1743dbf0795b0d3821a8781347ae05efb8"}
{"chunk_id": "use-training", "source_id": "project-guide", "title": "本次模型工作範圍", "text": "本次使用預訓練骨幹擷取特徵並建立正常記憶庫，沒有更新神經網路權重，履歷應描述特徵擷取、模型整合與評估，尚未累積模型微調（Fine-tuning）成果。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/docs/phase2_vision.md", "source_locator": "phase-two guide", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "4e8f0bfa9fa0ad1eaef4ab75beb71ba4c1359709beca61621913c1d2aa9ed80b"}
{"chunk_id": "use-split-leakage", "source_id": "project-scope", "title": "資料洩漏與索引範圍", "text": "正常參考圖索引只使用允許的訓練圖片，保留校準與測試資料不進入參考庫，同一張或相同像素圖片搜尋時需排除自身，避免資料洩漏（Data Leakage）。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/README.md", "source_locator": "資料切分 / 功能範圍", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "96f1136fc8973ff3a56b46762d7c601b1e8fb809e86d4807d702cb81af1ac082"}
{"chunk_id": "use-citation", "source_id": "project-scope", "title": "文件引用與主張", "text": "文件檢索（Document Retrieval）需回傳來源標題、段落編號與版本，引用編號存在只代表結構有效，回答是否得到段落支持仍需要主張支持度（Claim Support）評估。", "source_url": "https://github.com/chelsietao/InspectRAG-Agent/blob/main/README.md", "source_locator": "資料切分 / 功能範圍", "content_type": "authored_summary", "corpus_version": "knowledge-v1", "text_sha256": "6052664c83a009891afcd767b82b1ac63685a7e9787be58469c43e13fb009614"}
